WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:07.170
chuckle I have had a few rough months
some setbacks at work that hurt me

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:11.460
financially which is stressed out my
family I'm late on some payments I'm

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:16.890
falling further behind at work I don't
want to tap out but I just don't know

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:27.449
where to start well you know what that's
that's just kind of the way that life

00:00:27.449 --> 00:00:35.219
works sometimes it's it's Murphy's Law
when things go wrong they always seem to

00:00:35.219 --> 00:00:43.860
happen at once and they just compound on
top of each other and it's it's pretty

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:50.879
easy sometimes to to feel beaten when
you're faced with all those issues and

00:00:50.879 --> 00:00:57.510
all those problems and they all hit you
at the same time but let me tell you

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:10.140
that that doesn't mean give up in fact
it means the opposite it means it's time

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:19.009
for you to fight harder to dig in means
it's time for you to go on the warpath

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:25.320
and that starts with one of the
fundamental laws of combat leadership

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:31.380
prioritize and execute what's the
biggest problem what's causing the most

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:41.939
stress family okay sit them down explain
where you are at be blunt be upfront and

00:01:41.939 --> 00:01:48.049
then give them the simple plan of how
you're going to get things back on track

00:01:48.049 --> 00:01:55.260
don't sugarcoat it you give it to them
straight next

00:01:55.260 --> 00:02:02.820
got some some late payments call those
creditors up explain to them what's

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:08.910
going on set up some kind of a minimum
payment plan so you can start making

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:16.110
some progress and get them off your back
and then you got your job right you're

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:20.360
falling behind at work okay talk to your
boss

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:26.280
face it tell him that you're going to
step up your game tell him you're going

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:29.310
to be at work early you're gonna be at
work late you're going to be at work

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:33.900
during lunch you're going to be wherever
you need to be whenever he needs you to

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:38.880
be there
tell him you're gonna get after it and

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:46.260
tell that you're a hundred percent
committed to supporting him and the

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:56.940
company and the mission and then you get
started and I'm going to tell you right

00:02:56.940 --> 00:03:05.780
now it won't be easy it will be hard
because life is hard that's what life is

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:14.340
and these challenges these challenges
that you face they're gonna do their

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:29.040
best to take you down do not let them
stand up dig in line up those problems

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:39.440
and confront them face them fight them
do not let them bring you down in fact

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:50.070
in fact let those challenges raise you
up let them elevate you let their

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:55.640
demands and their trials make you
stronger

00:03:55.640 --> 00:04:05.870
let the adversity you face today turn
you into a better person tomorrow

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:17.030
so so in the future you look back at
these struggles and you say to them

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:24.440
thank you you made me better

